// CallingPostTelephonyConfigPeopleMeSettingsModeManagementFeaturesByFeatureIdActionsExtendModeInvoke is "Extend Current Operating Mode Duration": POST /telephony/config/people/me/settings/modeManagement/features/{featureId}/actions/extendMode/invoke.
